---
import LegalLayout from '../components/LegalLayout.astro';
import { href } from '../data/products';
---

<LegalLayout title="Refunds & returns" current="refunds" lead="30 days, no awkward questions, as long as the product did not work as described.">
  <h2>When you can get a refund</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The files are broken, incomplete or do not match the description.</li>
    <li>The tool does not run on the software version listed on the product page, and I cannot fix it.</li>
    <li>You bought the same product twice by mistake.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How long you have</h2>
  <p>You can request a refund within 30 days of the purchase date. Free products have no refund because they cost nothing.</p>

  <h2>How to request one</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the <a href={href('contacts/')}>contact form</a> and choose "Refund request".</li>
    <li>Include your order number and a short description of the problem.</li>
    <li>I reply within one business day. Approved refunds go back to the original payment method within 5 to 10 days.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>What happens to the licence</h2>
  <p>After a refund the licence ends and you should delete the files. Your licence key is deactivated and the product disappears from your library.</p>

  <h2>Not eligible</h2>
  <p>Refunds are not given because you changed your mind after downloading and using the files in a published or commercial project.</p>
</LegalLayout>
